    91	# self-declared at `init`. A change mislabelled L1 silently skips the L3 gates —
    92	# no alarm, no evidence that anything was skipped. This is the one place the
    93	# whole chain could be defeated by a typo or by optimism. So the tier a human
    94	# (or an AI) declares is now only a FLOOR CANDIDATE: `classify` reads the paths
